 focusing on the *literal* meaning of \"Case Inbox only\" -- just the words \"Case Inbox\". It\'s pretty direct. If I am really interpreting \"Case Inbox only\" I should keep the subtitle hidden. The user selected the `h1` element itself!\n\n\n"
